{"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ReactingToChanges"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Find the components that changed or went away, run code as changes happen, and pass messages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between the parts of a program."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Detecting Changes and Removals","anchor":"Detecting-Changes-and-Removals","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChangeTick","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent"],"generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Reacting to Changes","role":"article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A world gives you two ways to respond to what happens in it. You can look later: change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"detection, removal records and events keep track of what happened, and the code that cares reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them when it next runs. Or you can respond at once: hooks and observers run a closure as part of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the change that fired them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Look later when the response belongs in a system that runs every step anyway, such as a health"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bar that redraws when the health changed. Respond at once when other data must never fall out of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"step with the world, such as a directory of entities by name."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Find Components That Changed","anchor":"Find-Components-That-Changed","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every component remembers the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/changeTick","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" at which it was added and the one at which it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last changed. The "},{"code":"changed(_:since:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"added(_:since:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" filters pass only the entities whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component is newer than a tick. Inside a system run by a schedule, leave out the tick:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"changed(Health.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" then means “changed since this system last ran”. See “Find what changed”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Those filters check every entity that holds the type. When few of many entities change between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visits, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackChanges(of:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps a log of the type’s changes, so the filters cost time in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"proportion to what changed rather than to how many entities hold the type."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Find Components That Went Away","anchor":"Find-Components-That-Went-Away","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A removed component leaves nothing behind to filter on, so the world records removals instead.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/removed(_:by:)","isActive":true},{"text":" returns the entities that lost a component of a type since a reader last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asked, whether by removal or by despawn. A reader is any type you choose, so different parts of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"program each keep their own place.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Recording starts at the first call to "},{"code":"removed(_:by:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or at "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackRemovals(of:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removals before that aren’t reported. The record is kept as events are, so each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/updateEvents()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" drops the removals from before the previous one."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Run Code When Components Come and Go","anchor":"Run-Code-When-Components-Come-and-Go","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"hook"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is a closure the world runs when an entity gains, is given or loses a component of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-27g0l","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onInsert(_:perform:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onRemove(_:perform:)-2t2p","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Given a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in place of a type, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAdd"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onRemove"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run when an entity starts or stops matching the query. A hook runs after the operation that fired"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it has finished, so it sees the whole spawn or insert."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Hooks don’t run for changes made in place, through the subscript or an update. Use change","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"detection for those.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example keeps a list of the fallen as they’re despawned, and reads the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"despawn from the removal record afterward:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct Fallen: Resource { var names: [String] = [] }","enum TallyReader {}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Fallen())","_ = world.removed(Health.self, by: TallyReader.self)","world.onRemove(Name.self) { world, _, name in","    world.resources[Fallen.self].names.append(name.value)","}","","let knight = world.spawn(Name(value: \"knight\"), Health(current: 0))","world.despawn(knight)","","print(world.resources[Fallen.self].names)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"knight\"]\"","print(world.removed(Health.self, by: TallyReader.self) == [knight])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"Trigger Events on an Entity","anchor":"Trigger-Events-on-an-Entity","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" tells one entity that something happened to it, such as a barrel being hit."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Register observers with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:on:perform:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for one entity, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:perform:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for every entity, and fire the event with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trigger(_:on:)"},{"type":"text","text":". The observers run before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trigger(_:on:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returns. An event whose type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"propagates moves up the hierarchy ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"},{"type":"text","text":") after each entity’s observers run, until it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches the root or an observer stops it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Send Messages Between Systems","anchor":"Send-Messages-Between-Systems","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a message one part of a program sends and other parts read later, such as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collision that a damage system and a sound system both respond to. Send one with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/send(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and read it with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/readEvents(_:by:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Each reader reads each event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Events wait in two buffers, and each ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/updateEvents()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" drops the older one, so an event can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be read for the rest of the step it was sent in and all of the next. Call ","type":"text"},{"code":"updateEvents()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"step, such as with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"UpdateEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" system at the start of a frame. Without it, events are never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/reactingtochanges"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ChildOf":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The relation that links a child entity to its parent."}],"role":"symbol","title":"ChildOf","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof","type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/EntityEvent":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A type that describes something that happens to a particular entity, which its observers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"respond to at once.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/entityevent","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityEvent"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityEvent"}],"title":"EntityEvent"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/observe(_:on:perform:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an event of the given type is triggered on an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity, or propagates to it.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/observe(_:on:perform:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"observe"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"on","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule7TriggerV","text":"Trigger"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:on:perform:)","title":"observe(_:on:perform:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ChangeTick":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A point in a world’s history of changes."}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/changetick","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChangeTick","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ChangeTick","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChangeTick","title":"ChangeTick"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/onRemove(_:perform:)-2t2p":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onRemove(_:perform:)-2t2p","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onRemove"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"perform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an entity loses a component of the given type.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"onRemove(_:perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/onremove(_:perform:)-2t2p"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/QueryingAWorld":{"kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryingaworld","title":"Querying a World","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Find the entities that hold the components you need, read those components, and change them in place."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/changeTick":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/changeTick","title":"changeTick","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"changeTick","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChangeTick","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10ChangeTickV"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tick the world stamps on every component it adds or changes."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/changetick"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/readEvents(_:by:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/readevents(_:by:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"readEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Reader","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Reader"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventsView","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10EventsViewV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"role":"symbol","title":"readEvents(_:by:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/readEvents(_:by:)","abstract":[{"text":"Returns the events of a type that a reader hasn’t read yet, oldest first, and marks them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as read by that reader.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries, updates, and commands."}],"role":"collection","title":"WorldModule","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule","type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Query":{"type":"topic","title":"Query","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A description of the entities to visit and the components to read from each.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Query","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/query"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/onInsert(_:perform:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onInsert(_:perform:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onInsert"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an entity is given a component of the given type,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether it’s new or replaces one the entity held."}],"role":"symbol","title":"onInsert(_:perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/oninsert(_:perform:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Event":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a message one part of a program sends and other parts read later."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"title":"Event","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/event","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/onAdd(_:perform:)-27g0l":{"abstract":[{"text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an entity gains a component of the given type.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-27g0l","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"onAdd(_:perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/onadd(_:perform:)-27g0l","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onAdd","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/trackRemovals(of:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Starts recording every entity that loses a component of the given type.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackRemovals(of:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"trackRemovals(of:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/trackremovals(of:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trackRemovals","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type)"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/updateEvents()":{"abstract":[{"text":"Ends an update for every event type, dropping the events sent before the previous","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"update.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/updateEvents()","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"updateEvents()","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/updateevents()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"updateEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/send(_:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sends an event for readers of its type."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/send(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/send(_:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"send"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"send(_:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/trigger(_:on:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Triggers an event on an entity, running its observers before returning.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trigger(_:on:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/trigger(_:on:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trigger","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"on"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"title":"trigger(_:on:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/trackChanges(of:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/trackchanges(of:)","type":"topic","title":"trackChanges(of:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackChanges(of:)","abstract":[{"text":"Starts logging which entities have a component of the given type added or changed, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that finding the ones changed since a tick costs time in proportion to how many changed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not to how many hold the type.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"trackChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type)"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/removed(_:by:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns the entities that lost a component of the given type since a reader last asked,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"oldest first.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/removed(_:by:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removed"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Reader","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Reader"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type) -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/removed(_:by:)","title":"removed(_:by:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/RemovedComponent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/removedcomponent","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"RemovedComponent","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RemovedComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The event a world sends when an entity loses a component of type "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RemovedComponent","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/observe(_:perform:)":{"title":"observe(_:perform:)","abstract":[{"text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an event of the given type is triggered on any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/observe(_:perform:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"observe","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","text":"World"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule7TriggerV","text":"Trigger"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic"}}}